{% block summary %}
<p>
    <em>This implementation model is an implementation model of the <a target="_blank" href="https://belgif.github.io/thematic/models/public%20services/index_en.html">ICEG application profile public service</a>
        and follows the <a target="_blank" href="https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/dienst">OSLO Vocabulary 'Service'</a>.
        Many things are taken from the ICEG model and are therefore only described in English. Specific extensions within this data model are described in Dutch.    </em>
</p>

<p>This implementation model is used to exchange data on public services between IPDC (version 3) and LPDC.
    It describes how to communicate to and from the local product and service catalogue (LPDC) and the inter-administrative product and service catalogue (IPDC).</p>

<h4>JSON-LD Context</h4>
<p>
    <em>The JSON-LD contexts below are managed by the IPDC team of Digital Flanders.    </em>
    <br>
    <br>A reusable JSON-LD context for this deployment model can be found at the following location:    <ul>
        <li><a target="_blank" href="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Informatievlaanderen/ipdc-lpdc/ontwerp-2024-07-04/jsonld/ipdc-lpdc-im.jsonld">IPDC-LPDC JSON-LD context</a></li>
    </ul>In addition to exchanging individual instances, concepts and associated snapshots, it is also possible to exchange lists of this data. This is done in several ways:    <ul>
        <li>Lists of instance and draft snapshots are provided paginated using the <a target="_blank" href="https://semiceu.github.io/LinkedDataEventStreams/">LDES specification</a>.
            In the following <a target="_blank" href="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Informatievlaanderen/ipdc-lpdc/ontwerp-2024-07-04/jsonld/ldes.jsonld">LDES JSON-LD context</a> , the definitions used are determined.        </li>
        <li>Lists of instances and concepts are provided paginated using the <a target="_blank" href="https://www.hydra-cg.com/spec/latest/core/">Hydra specification</a>.
            In the following <a target="_blank" href="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Informatievlaanderen/ipdc-lpdc/ontwerp-2024-07-04/jsonld/hydra.jsonld">Hydra JSON-LD context</a> , the definitions used are determined.        </li>
    </ul>
</p>

